<title>INDONESIA: Fiskaragung Q1 net up to 28.44 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Fiskaragung Q1 net up to 28.44 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah except earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			28.44 vs  13.41</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)   57  vs  34</p>
<p>    Net sales			 94.33 vs  51.17</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    40.15 vs  22.21</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  36.13 vs  18.78</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	    129.25 vs  34.06</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Fiskaragung Perkasa is a salt processor.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom, +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
